{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1320318001:1":{"text":"咳咳……抱歉，我的病一直不见起色，只有躺着才能好受点……","source_cn":"咳咳……抱歉，我的病一直不见起色，只有躺着才能好受点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F6529889B3C951A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320318002:1":{"text":"你们找我……是有什么事吗？","source_cn":"你们找我……是有什么事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AB0FF00F88C963F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320318003:1":{"text":"我们的朋友从一位商人手里买下了你创作的一幅画，但那幅画到手时就已经破损了……","source_cn":"我们的朋友从一位商人手里买下了你创作的一幅画，但那幅画...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF077AC13EC3643C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320318004:1":{"text":"那位朋友觉得很可惜，所以想问问你那幅画身上到底发生了什么事。","source_cn":"那位朋友觉得很可惜，所以想问问你那幅画身上到底发生了什么事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96F830BDF3B4E030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320318005:1":{"text":"唔，我们不知道那幅画的名字……但听卖画的商人说，它是一位银行家收来的抵债品。你还记得是哪一幅吗？","source_cn":"唔，我们不知道那幅画的名字……但听卖画的商人说，它是一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19663F6F83C1B7D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320318006:1":{"text":"咳——咳！！","source_cn":"咳——咳！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E699CD8BE4A07D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320318007:1":{"text":"原来是那一幅啊……我记得，我当然记得……","source_cn":"原来是那一幅啊……我记得，我当然记得……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x040F711F8E054EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320318008:1":{"text":"那幅画，是我生病前创作的最后一幅画，也是我灵感涌现的得意之作……","source_cn":"那幅画，是我生病前创作的最后一幅画，也是我灵感涌现的得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD98E41ACFE2E4589","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320318009:1":{"text":"创作它的时候，我的灵感源源不绝，我以为艾雅女神终于眷顾了我……所以，我把所有最好的东西都用于那幅画上……","source_cn":"创作它的时候，我的灵感源源不绝，我以为艾雅女神终于眷顾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05FD8E56D042E47D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320318010:1":{"text":"最坚韧的画布，最珍贵的颜料，最顺手的画笔……","source_cn":"最坚韧的画布，最珍贵的颜料，最顺手的画笔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E1783D0D24C7EE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320318011:1":{"text":"只要完成