cument_title_status":""},"say:19:1320318018:1":{"text":"那些人……无论是商人，还是银行家……他们只在乎画的价值，根本不懂艺术，欣赏不来那幅画的珍贵。","source_cn":"那些人……无论是商人，还是银行家……他们只在乎画的价值...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EEC91A4665BD2B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320318019:1":{"text":"在他们争抢的过程中，那幅画……被甩到了杂物堆里，才破损成这个样子……","source_cn":"在他们争抢的过程中，那幅画……被甩到了杂物堆里，才破损...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x574D8F13C0B149B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320318020:1":{"text":"居然是这样……看到那幅画被毁，你一定很心痛。","source_cn":"居然是这样……看到那幅画被毁，你一定很心痛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6567636D20D7A393","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1320318021:1":{"text":"是啊，它是我最后的心血了……","source_cn":"是啊，它是我最后的心血了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A2C0534113D85B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320318022:1":{"text":"别担心，我们那位朋友很欣赏你的这幅画！肯定会好好保存它的！","source_cn":"别担心，我们那位朋友很欣赏你的这幅画！肯定会好好保存它的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB03B9450889F0F96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1320318023:1":{"text":"是吗，那就好……有人欣赏它就好……","sour